<title>BRAZIL: FORECAST-Individual survey of Brazilian indicators.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Individual survey of Brazilian indicators.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are individual economic forecasts collected by Reuters from the offices of eight brokerages and research firms in Sao Paulo and Rio de Janeiro. The survey is updated twice monthly after the release of export figures early in the month and trade balance later in the month.</p>
<p>	 *****Brazil Individual Economic Forecasts*****</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>PERIOD	    January	 January		January</p>
<p>INDICATOR	CPI (Fipe)  PPI (IPA-M/FGV)   Infltn (IGP-M/FGV)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Banco da Bahia   1.15 pct	na		   0.60 pct</p>
<p>Banco de Boston  1.29 pct	na		   na</p>
<p>Fonte Cindam     1.00 pct	1.68   pct	 1.66  pct</p>
<p>JP Morgan	  1.20 pct	na		   1.90  pct</p>
<p>Matrix	     1.00 pct	2.00   pct	 1.85  pct</p>
<p>MCM Consultores  1.30 pct	2.46   pct	 2.20  pct</p>
<p>Trend		0.87 pct	2.37   pct	 2.18  pct</p>
<p>Unibanco	   0.91 pct	0.92   pct	 1.07  pct</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>PERIOD		December	January	  $bln	  $bln</p>
<p>INDICATOR	Ind Act (IBGE)  Trade  $million    Exports    Imports</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Banco da Bahia   7.00 pct	  -500	   3.470	  3.970</p>
<p>Banco de Boston  10.4 pct	  -771	   3.467	  4.238</p>
<p>Fonte Cindam     12.4 pct	  -1,000	 3.500	  4.500</p>
<p>JP Morgan	  8.00 pct	  -1,425	 3.590	  5.015</p>
<p>Matrix	     5.00 pct	  -500	   3.500	  4.000</p>
<p>MCM Consultores  4.50 pct	  -1,100	 3.500	  4.600</p>
<p>Trend		8.30 pct	  -1,000	 3.500	  4.500</p>
<p>Unibanco	   8.90 pct	  -931	   3.470	  4.401</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Notes - - Price indicators reflect monthly variation. Industrial activity reflects annual variation. (a) indicates actual figure.</p>
<p>((--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414))</p>
